#X text 1500 1330 A 50 Hz frame clock that repaints only when dirty \, unlike g_oled: these are ALSA MIDI writes \, on top of about 96 a second from the clock. Idle \, it sends nothing (ref/module/display.md)., f 90;
#X text 1500 1520 The spigot comes before the flag is cleared \, so what changed while the surface was not ours is painted in the first frame back., f 90;
#X text 2100 990 The port is an object-box \$1: in a message box \$1 is the incoming message's first atom (ref/conventions.md \, C-1)., f 50;
