#X text 2100 1100 inlet 2 carries meaning \, never a cell: steps and the selected track's sixteen velocities \, play and the playhead's step \, vel and the selected level \, track and the selected pad. cut-it-drum-page.txt says which cell is which \, and u_map reads the same file \, so a press and its lamp cannot disagree. C-5, f 50;
